{
  "id": 15090285445485,
  "title": "Ribbit Pendantz Blindbox",
  "handle": "ribbit-pendantz-blindbox",
  "description": "<h2>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong>Note:<b><u> This item is on pre-order and </u></b></strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><b><u>orders made after August 7 will begin shipping in mid-January.</u></b></strong></span>\n</h2>\n<p>“It’s been pretty lonely in the Glitch Laboratory after the release of our last Pendantz, so we designed a Ribbit Pendantz who would be the perfect friend.  Let’s just hope there’s no friendship breakups, haha. That did not go well last time.” - Glitch Vibes Officer</p>\n<p>The Ribbit Pendantz are here! Inside this box is a randomly picked keychain pendant featuring Ribbit from The Amazing Digital Circus in some recognisable costumes. Crack one open and see what you get-it may even be the mysterious Super Rare!</p>\n<p><strong>How it works:</strong><br>Each single box contains a pendant of a random costume, with a chance of finding the rare (or better) costume.</p>\n<p>Each Common has a 1/5 chance of appearing, the Rare pendant has a 1/14 chance of appearing, and the Super Rare pendant has a 1/42 chance.</p>\n<p>The set pack contains 6 boxes with no double-ups and a guaranteed rare OR super rare pendant if bought online. In the event a set pack contains both a rare AND a super rare, one of the common rarity figures will be replaced.</p>\n<p><strong>Featuring:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Iconic Ribbit</li>\n<li>Anime Ribbit</li>\n<li>Noir Ribbit</li>\n<li>Maid Ribbit</li>\n<li>Kaufmo-Suit Ribbit</li>\n<li>Rare: Jax-Suit Ribbit</li>\n<li>Super Rare: ???</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Designed by Courtney Brenek @courtneybrenek, Rosie \"Puffcake\" de Bruin @PuffcakeRosie, Dylan Langmaid @Dylanwilldo<br>Packaging Design by Latticha L, Star Liu</p>",
